\u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0637\u0631 1115)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/authoring-skills/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L30-50", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "List ideas skip the seven-question gate entirely since they are pre-vetted."}, {"id": "authoring_skills_skill_read_line_range_mandatory", "label": "\u0625\u0644\u0632\u0627\u0645\u064a\u0651: \u0627\u0642\u0631\u0623 \u0646\u0637\u0627\u0642 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0633\u0637\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u0639\u0644\u064a \u0641\u064a day-04.html \u0644\u0627 \u062a\u0641\u062a\u0631\u0636 \u0645\u0636\u0645\u0648\u0646\u0647", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/authoring-skills/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L47-50", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "authoring_skills_skill_idea_7_gmail_constraint", "label": "\u0641\u0643\u0631\u0629 #7 (\u0641\u0631\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0631\u064a\u062f) \u062a\u062d\u062a\u0627\u062c Gmail \u0645\u0648\u0635\u0648\u0644\u064b\u0627 \u0641\u0639\u0644\u064b\u0627 \u0648\u062a\u0641\u0631\u0632 \u0641\u0642\u0637\u060c \u0644\u0627 \u062a\u0635\u0646\u0651\u0641", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/authoring-skills/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L54-55", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Check the connection for real, not by assumption; if unconnected, guide the trainee to Settings->Connectors->Gmail->Connect first."}, {"id": "authoring_skills_skill_six_slots_elicitation", "label": "\u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0633\u062a\u0651: \u0645\u062a\u0649 \u062a\u0639\u0645\u0644 \u00b7 \u0645\u0627\u0630\u0627 \u062a\u0639\u0645\u0644 \u00b7 \u0645\u0627 \u062a\u062d\u062a\u0627\u062c \u00b7 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0637\u0648\u0627\u062a \u00b7 \u0648\u064a\u0646 \u062a\u0633\u0623\u0644 \u00b7 \u0645\u0639\u064a\u0627\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0646\u062c\u0627\u062d", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/authoring-skills/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L57-74", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each slot gets 2-4 concrete AskUserQuestion options, never an open question - same lesson logged in writing-requirements \u00a75.1.1, heavier here because the trainee authors rather than only reviews."}, {"id": "authoring_skills_skill_vary_options_by_source", "label": "\u0646\u0648\u0651\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u064a\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a: \u0645\u0646 \u00a72 \u0628\u064a\u0646 \u0635\u064a\u063a\u0629 \u0642\u0631\u064a\u0628\u0629 \u0645\u0646 day-04 \u0648\u0635\u064a\u063a\u0629 \u0645\u0646 \u0645\u0634\u0631\u0648\u0639\u0647\u061b \u0645\u0646 \u00a71 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0627\u0639\u062a\u0645\u0627\u062f \u0639\u0644\u0649 PRODUCT.md", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/authoring-skills/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L59-64", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "This variation is what makes it his own version of the skill rather than one identical copy for everyone who picks the same list idea."}, {"id": "authoring_skills_skill_one_file_cap", "label": "\u062d\u062f\u0651 \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0645: \u0645\u0644\u0641\u0651 SKILL.md \u0648\u0627\u062d\u062f \u0641\u0642\u0637\u060c \u0628\u0644\u0627 references \u0623\u0648 scripts (\u062a\u0648\u062c\u064a\u0647 \u0644\u0627 \u0645\u0646\u0639)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "project-package/.claude/skills/authoring-skills/SKILL.md", "source_location": "L75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "authoring_skills_skill_handoff_to_skill_creator", "label": "\u0627\u0644\u062a\u0633\u0644\u064a\u0645 \u2014 \u0633\u0644\u0651\u0645 \u062